{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Lex Sprint 是一款專為 IELTS 口語 Part 3 而設的主動詞彙訓練 App，針對考生「看得懂卻說不出」的困境，透過認知原型、社會張力框架與道地詞塊，訓練考生自然表達複雜觀點，目標直指 Band 7.5 以上。程式原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合正準備應考 IELTS 的 iPhone 與 iPad 用戶。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-117.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>四階段課程活化被動詞彙</h2>\n<p>Lex Sprint 內置 18 個高頻主題模組，涵蓋教育、全球化、環境、城市化與公共政策等常見題材，並以 483 節課堂組成四階段課程，由認知概念、自然詞塊搭配，推進至複雜論證與完整 Part 3 模擬。App 以裝置端語音辨識即時轉錄並標示目標詞塊，說話後評估主動詞彙比率；配合智能間隔重複，自動追蹤較弱詞語並安排複習。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-565-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-566-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-567-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-568-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-569-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-570-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Lex Sprint</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/lex-sprint/id6817379958?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:09.186798+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":391,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:30:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:32.045298+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:13.167476+00:00","content_hash":"29fbb63beeac25050950adca2352c03eb987bd27adbc7aed51737cd0bd2fbbd0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}